claim.claim-text:
(i) one of a predefined plurality of rasters;
(ii) a bitmap indicating with each bit for one raster time point whether or not a paging occasion is included in said raster time point;
(iii) a short-bitmap which is shorter than the number of raster points in the paging cycle, the short-bitmap, when cyclically repeated, indicate with each bit for one raster time point whether or not a paging occasion is included in said raster time point.
